ull, "rationale": "ui.widgets.build_main_ui assigns app.tree, form_frame, status_var, busy_buttons, progress_bar, cancel_button; create_combobox_styles must run first so named styles exist; any attribute it sets must not be re-created in App."}, {"id": "claude_widget_state_str_comparison", "label": "Compare str(widget.cget('state'))", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ttk returns a Tcl_Obj that never equals a str, which silently left read-only fields unfilled."}, {"id": "claude_background_work_pattern", "label": "run_in_background worker + queue + root.after(100) pump", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L66", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Workers run on a thread and must never touch widgets; results are delivered on the main thread by _pump_events draining a queue.Queue; ProductTreeWindow and ObsoleteProductsWindow share the pattern instead of update_idletasks loops."}, {"id": "claude_component_tables", "label": "Component category tables (19 tables)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_kicad_dbl_table_sync", "label": "Table names must match BrensanDB.kicad_dbl libraries[].table", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "KiCad reads the .kicad_dbl, so renaming or adding a table means editing that file too."}, {"id": "claude_runtime_schema_discovery", "label": "Runtime schema discovery (sqlite_master, PRAGMA table_info)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schema is never declared; the form is generated from discovered columns and ensure_extra_columns_for_table auto-ALTERs EXTRA_DB_COLUMNS on load."}, {"id": "claude_system_tables", "label": "db.SYSTEM_TABLES / is_system_table()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_normalize_key_convention", "label": "_normalize_key central matching convention", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lowercase, \u00b5/\u03bc -> u, drop \u00b0, strip non-alphanumerics; every column/alias/supplier-field match goes through it so 'Manufacturer Part Number', Manufacturer_Part_Number and manufacturerpartnumber resolve to one column; extend alias lists rather than adding ad-hoc header checks."}, {"id": "claude_plus_and_search", "label": "Search splits on + into AND-ed tokens", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_login_flow", "label": "main(): backup -> run_login_flow -> App(root, user)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L80", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_password_storage", "label": "PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 per-user-salt password digests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L82", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_password_reset", "label": "Single-use 15-minute reset tokens + loopback page + TLS SMTP", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L84", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_verified_permission_rule", "label": "Non-admin Verified rule enforced inside db.py writers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L86", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Enforced in all four writers, not only the UI: non-admins cannot set Verified nor edit/move/delete a verified row (_check_verified_write, any truthy spelling); current_user_is_admin requires an active admin row so a deactivated admin is a plain user."}, {"id": "claude_audited_component_writes", "label": "All component writes via db.insert/update/delete/move_data_to_table", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L88", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "These set Created/Modified audit columns themselves, insert a Change_Log row in the same transaction and emit brensan.audit after commit; raw SQL loses the trail; update_data skips when nothing differs."}, {"id": "claude_connection_context_manager", "label": "db.connection(commit=False) context manager", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L90", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Always closes and rolls back on error; tests monkeypatch db.get_connection which connection() resolves at call time, so never sqlite3.connect(DB_FILE) directly."}, {"id": "claude_product_tree_hierarchy", "label": "Product Tree PT_* schema (Boards, Revisions, Lines, ProjectBoards, Components)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L94", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_product_tree_rules", "label": "Product Tree permission/sharing rules pinned by tests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L96-L103", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"i