pping", "label": "map_digikey/lcsc_value_to_form_column + KiCad value formatters", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L109", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_duplicate_alias_keys_hazard", "label": "Watch for duplicate dict keys in alias maps", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L109", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Python keeps only the last duplicate key; two separate Current/Power entries once made half the aliases unreachable; tests/test_digikey.py guards it."}, {"id": "claude_api_key_rotation", "label": "API-Keys.json + ApiKeyManager daily-usage rotation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L110", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_local_stock_ambiguity", "label": "Missing/malformed stock response is never zero stock", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L111", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AmbiguousStockResult keeps old values; bom_stock caches an unreachable server per job so an offline server costs one timeout per BOM, not one per row."}, {"id": "claude_app_dir_paths", "label": "config.py frozen-aware APP_DIR and LIBRARY_ROOT", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L115-L121", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every data file lives in APP_DIR (exe dir when frozen); LIBRARY_ROOT found by walking up to Footprints.pretty or a .kicad_dbl; config.py re-reads settings.json itself to stay import-cycle free."}, {"id": "claude_no_internal_folder", "label": "Nothing may depend on PyInstaller _internal/ or __file__", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L